==Event Information==
The Battle Cats Celebrates {{Color|#FF0000|'''17 Million Worldwide Downloads'''}}!<br>
Event Period: Jan. 30th - Feb. 15th

{{Color|#FF6600|'''☆Event One☆'''}}<br>
All users receive {{Color|#FF00FF|'''10 Cat Food'''}} each day for 17 straight days, on top of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''one free Rare Ticket'''}} at the start!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''☆Event Two☆'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Monthly Event Revival'''}}! Past events will re-appear in alternation.<br>
- October Event: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Occult Festival"'''}}<br>
- November Event: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Loving Labour"'''}}<br>
- December Event: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Jingle Cat Bell"'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''☆Event Three☆'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Half-Off Item Sale'''}}<br>
Event Period: Jan. 30th - Feb. 4th

{{Color|#FF6600|'''☆Event Four☆'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Victory Booster Campaign'''}}! Event Period: Jan. 30th - Feb. 28th<br>
Users who clear or have already cleared the Japan stage during this event will receive a gift of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''1 Rare Ticket'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''10,000 XP'''}}!<br>
Furthermore, users who clear or have already cleared all 48 stages of the first story mode chapter "The Battle Cats Rising" will receive a gift of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''3 Rare Tickets'''}}!!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>For further details on each event, please refer to the announcements for each individual campaign.

